  1. Clear all stations
  2. Send Mover_1 to _StationStart.rPosWait 
  3. Send all other movers with higher target pos, so Mover_1 will be leading the pack
  4. Check for arrival of Mover_1 and all mover standstill
  5. re-target all other Movers to Mover_1 target.
  6. Enter all ST_MOVER_DATA into the LinkedList of the Station at fb_TransportUnit.StationStartIndex 
